1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,916
Every dApp begins with an idea.

2
00:00:03,096 --> 00:00:06,478
It becomes useful when real people help it improve.

3
00:00:06,658 --> 00:00:12,897
LionDApp connects Seeker users and builders through discovery, honest feedback, and structured testing.

4
00:00:13,577 --> 00:00:16,632
Start with the Solana dApp Store catalog.

5
00:00:16,812 --> 00:00:21,486
Find an app, explore its details, and see the community conversation around it.

6
00:00:21,666 --> 00:00:28,008
Catalog information stays separate from community opinions, so users understand what they are reading.

7
00:00:28,688 --> 00:00:31,037
Choose the app you actually used.

8
00:00:31,217 --> 00:00:34,789
Share an issue, a suggestion, or something worth praising.

9
00:00:34,969 --> 00:00:40,435
Clear sections keep the experience readable; comments and replies have their own space.

10
00:00:40,615 --> 00:00:43,371
Follow the conversation as it develops.

11
00:00:43,551 --> 00:00:46,537
The goal is feedback a builder can act on.

12
00:00:47,217 --> 00:00:50,930
Builders can invite people to test a specific app version.

13
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:56,578
Define the steps, number of places, deadline, and report requirements before anyone joins.

14
00:00:56,758 --> 00:01:00,624
Testers reserve a place and submit a dedicated report.

15
00:01:00,804 --> 00:01:05,396
Hosts can request a correction, then review it against those requirements.

16
00:01:05,576 --> 00:01:08,443
A negative finding can still be valuable.

17
00:01:09,123 --> 00:01:16,131
Participation uses Mobile Wallet Adapter, wallet signatures, and verified .skr ownership.

18
00:01:16,311 --> 00:01:18,164
Browsing stays open.

19
00:01:18,344 --> 00:01:22,689
Reporting, blocking, and moderation support safer conversations.

20
00:01:22,869 --> 00:01:27,979
This verifies account control; it does not certify that someone represents an app.

21
00:01:28,659 --> 00:01:31,673
English is our default for a global community.

22
00:01:31,853 --> 00:01:39,237
Chinese helps Seeker owners who are less comfortable with English understand the interface and participate more confidently.

23
00:01:39,417 --> 00:01:42,384
Community posts keep their original language.

24
00:01:42,564 --> 00:01:45,546
We will add more languages based on feedback.

25
00:01:46,226 --> 00:01:48,271
Free testing works today.

26
00:01:48,451 --> 00:01:56,420
Our next step is creator funded SKR testing, with rewards and a ten percent platform fee deposited before recruitment.

27
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:59,583
Real funding and payouts are not live yet.

28
00:01:59,763 --> 00:02:02,477
We will build and validate them carefully.

29
00:02:03,157 --> 00:02:08,011
Our vision is a shared feedback layer where users help builders create better dApps.

30
00:02:08,191 --> 00:02:12,585
We are committed to listening, testing, and improving, release after release.

31
00:02:12,765 --> 00:02:19,559
Better service for users, stronger products for developers, and a healthier Solana dApp Store for the long term.
